step Three Corners
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip The road from Elwynn enters Redridge at Three Corners. Guard Parker stands where the roads to Redridge and Duskwood meet.
  accept 244                                  -- Guard Parker walks around Three Corners: look inside the circle on the map

step Lakeridge Highway
  tip Follow the road along the south shore of Lake Everstill to the gryphon master. Deputy Feldon and Guard Howe stand by the road next to her.
  getfp "Lakeshire"
  turnin 244                                  -- Deputy Feldon
  accept 98407
  accept 246
  accept 128                                  -- Guard Howe

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lakeshire

step Lakeshire
  tip Cross the long bridge north into town. Foreman Oslow and Marshal Marris stand at the north end of the bridge, Bailiff Conacher in the town hall, Dockmaster Baren and Wiley the Black on the docks, Chef Breanna at the inn, Martie Jainrose in her garden at the west end.
  accept 20                                   -- Marshal Marris
  accept 98387
  accept 125                                  -- Foreman Oslow
  accept 91                                   -- Bailiff Conacher, in the town hall
  accept 150                                  -- Dockmaster Baren
  accept 127
  turnin 65                                   -- Wiley the Black, by the docks; upstairs
  sethome "Lakeshire"
  accept 129                          -- Inside
  accept 92                                   -- Chef Breanna, inside
  accept 34                                   -- Martie Jainrose

