step Lakeridge Highway: kill these as you meet them
  label q127
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Redridge Mongrels and other gnolls hold the hills east of Three Corners, north of the road; Redridge Thrashers prowl among them, Poachers camp south of the road. Redridge Brutes, for the Iron Pikes and Rivets, hold the hills further north; Dire Condors and Great Goretusks roam the hills east of them.
  collect 2296 quest 92                       -- Great Goretusk Snout
  collect 280911 quest 98407                  -- Spiked Collar: Redridge Thrashers
  kill 423 quest 246                          -- Redridge Mongrel
  collect 1467 quest 127
  kill 424 quest 246                          -- Redridge Poacher

