# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East of the lake

step Lake Everstill: kill these as you meet them
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Murloc Flesheaters and Tidecallers line the south shore east of the bridge. Any of them can carry a Spotted Sunfish or a fin.
  tip Greater Tarantulas crawl on the slopes around the mill north-east of the lake.
  collect 1467 quest 127                      -- Spotted Sunfish
  collect 1468 quest 150                      -- Murloc Fin
  collect 1080 quest 92                       -- Tough Condor Meat
  collect 1081 quest 92                       -- Crisp Spider Meat
  kill 505 quest 98386                        -- Greater Tarantula

step Blackrock camps
  tip South-east from the mill, west of Galardell Valley's gnolls, to the Blackrock camps east of Stonewatch Keep. Renegades, Grunts and Outrunners fill them; keep east of the keep, whose orcs are elite. Weapon racks and swords lie about the camps; meat haunches, grain sacks and water barrels hold the supplies. Kill the camps' orcs until level 23: Galardell Valley's gnolls, next, are 22-25, and Duskwood's quests start at 24.
  collect 3014 quest 20 @71,70.5 map 1433 live -- Battleworn Axe
  collect 280841 quest 98387 @71.7,75.7 map 1433 live -- Stolen Weapon: weapon racks and swords on the ground
  collect 280839 quest 98387 @70.6,79.7 map 1433 live -- Blackrock Supplies: meat haunches, grain sacks, water barrels
  level 23

step Galardell Valley
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip North up the valley's east side. Shadowhide gnolls fill it; Lieutenant Fangore (26) and his two guards stand at its north end: keep clear of them. Stay out of Stonewatch Keep to the west: its orcs are elite.
  collect 1075 quest 91                       -- Shadowhide Pendant: any Shadowhide gnoll

step A Watchful Eye
  tip The Old Lion Statue stands at the valley's east edge.
  turnin 94
  accept 248

step Looking Further
  tip West to the intact watch tower beside Stonewatch Keep: climb it and leave the Glyph in the empty jar at the top.
  turnin 248

step Back to Lakeshire
  turnin 20                                   -- Marshal Marris
  turnin 98387
  turnin 98386                                -- Foreman Oslow
  turnin 91                                   -- Bailiff Conacher, in the town hall
  turnin 150                                  -- Dockmaster Baren
  turnin 127
  turnin 92                                   -- Chef Breanna, inside
  vendor nearest

step Bellygrub
  tip Bellygrub (level 24) roots around the pen just west of Lakeshire. Pull him away from the other boars and fight at full health.
  collect 3631 quest 34                       -- Bellygrub's Tusk

step Martie Jainrose
  turnin 34

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Render's Valley

step Render's Valley
  tip Head north out of Lakeshire up the Redridge Canyons to Render's Valley. Blackrock Champions camp in the valley.
  kill 435 quest 128                          -- Blackrock Champion, below ground

step Corporal Keeshan
  tip Keeshan hides at the very north end of the valley, by the Burning Steppes border. Escort him down to Lakeshire; Blackrock orcs ambush you on the way.
  accept 219                                  -- Corporal Keeshan, below ground
  complete 219

step Lakeshire
  turnin 219                                  -- Marshal Marris
  turnin 128                                  -- Guard Howe, by the gryphons south of the bridge
  note Duskwood is next: follow the road west to Three Corners, then south to Darkshire.
